============================================================

Before implementing any new major feature:

1. Read this document first.
2. Check whether the feature is already marked DONE.
3. Do not duplicate existing APIs/services/components.
4. Preserve the ML/backend/frontend separation.
5. Do not replace real backend data with mock data.
6. Do not add hard-coded geography to the map.
7. Do not claim a feature is complete until it has been tested.
8. Preserve existing evidence media infrastructure.
9. Preserve existing analytics integration.
10. Preserve existing PostGIS coordinate handling.
11. Update this document after each major milestone.
12. Update the integration log after every significant implementation phase.

